    "type": "question",
    "label": "10",
    "prompt": "A bowl contains green and blue marbles. There are 14 green marbles and 70 blue marbles. What is the ratio of the number of green marbles to the number of blue marbles?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$1:5$",
      "worked": "Take 14 marbles as 1 part. There is 1 part of green marbles and 5 parts of blue marbles.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{green}:\\text{blue}&=14:70\\\\\\text{green}:\\text{blue}&=(14\\div14):(70\\div14)\\\\\\text{green}:\\text{blue}&=1:5\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
